<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>My Cherry Blossom Site</title>
<style>
    body { 
        background-color: #FFD1DC; 
        color: #FFFFFF; 
        font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 50px 20px;
        margin: 0;
    }

    h1 { 
        font-size: 3.5rem; 
        text-shadow: 2px 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); 
        margin-bottom: 10px; 
    }

    p {
        font-size: 1.4rem; 
        font-weight: 300; 
        margin-bottom: 40px; 
    }

    /* This container makes sure the images fit well on the page */
    .image-container { 
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 20px;
        margin-top: 20px; 
    }

    img {
        width: 350px; 
        height: 250px;
        object-fit: cover; 
        border-radius: 20px; 
        /* Your white border */
        border: 10px solid #FFFFFF; 
        box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); 
        transition: transform 0.4s ease; 
    }

    img:hover {
        transform: scale(1.05);
    }

    .links-section {
        margin-top: 60px;
    }

    .links-section a {
        color: #FFFFFF;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: bold;
        display: block;
        margin: 15px 0;
        font-size: 1.3rem;
    }

    .links-section a:hover {
        text-decoration: underline;
    }

    ul {
        list-style-type: none;
        padding: 0;
        margin-bottom: 40px;
    }
</style>
</head>
<body>

    <h1>Cherry Blossoms</h1>
    <p>Welcome to my beautiful, pink-themed website.</p>
    
    <h2>About the Creator</h2>
    <p>I am a junior who goes to the Hun school, I like to learn and read, I think Cherry blossoms are very pretty.</p>
    
    <ul>
        <li>Green is rare</li>
        <li>Yellow is rare</li>
        <li>Shades of pink are the most common</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="image-container">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522383225653-ed111181a951?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="Bright pink cherry blossoms">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1493673272479-a7e6c8369948?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="Soft light pink blossoms">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1521033029917-5975a2d7d35e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="Deep pink blossoms">
    </div>

    <div class="links-section">
        <a href="https://www.nps.gov/subjects/cherryblossom/bloom-development.htm">How different cherry blossom colors develop</a>
        <a href="https://www.arborday.org/trees/treeguide/treedetail.cfm?itemID=919">What conditions cherry blossoms grow in</a>
        <a href="https://www.loc.gov/item/today-in-history/march-27/">History of cherry blossoms</a>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
